---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Terms & Refund Policy | BiodataPDF" description="Terms of use, pricing and refund policy for BiodataPDF premium templates.">
	<main class="sec"><div class="wrap prose">
		<h1>Terms &amp; Refund Policy</h1>
		<h2>Pricing</h2>
		<p>Premium Plus templates are ₹49, Premium Pro ₹99 and Royal Collection ₹149 per template. The All-Access Pass is ₹499 and unlocks every premium template on the device where it was purchased.</p>
		<h2>Digital delivery</h2>
		<p>Unlocks are delivered instantly after payment. You can preview every premium template in demo mode before paying.</p>
		<h2>Refunds</h2>
		<p>If a payment succeeded but your template did not unlock, or you were charged twice, email us within 7 days with your payment ID and we will fix it or refund you. Refunds are processed to the original payment method within 5 to 7 working days.</p>
		<h2>Use of templates</h2>
		<p>Templates are for personal use to create your own biodata. Reselling or redistributing the templates is not allowed.</p>
	</div></main>
</SiteLayout>
